{"4703570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blood Park", "steam_appid": 4703570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You find two forgotten VHS tapes.<br>No labels. Only dirt and scratches.<br>Curiosity wins — you insert the first tape into an old VCR.<br><br>Someone’s nightmare begins to play.</i></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Park</strong> is an atmospheric first-person VHS horror game where you experience the story hidden inside mysterious recordings.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned locations, collect scattered notes, and survive encounters with terrifying creatures while uncovering what happened inside the park.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore forgotten places</h2></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703570/extras/ad8c285cb055105f46b76a31147ef0f0.poster.avif?t=1782379430\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703570/extras/ad8c285cb055105f46b76a31147ef0f0.webm?t=1782379430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703570/extras/ad8c285cb055105f46b76a31147ef0f0.mp4?t=1782379430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through an abandoned park, a crypt, and underground catacombs filled with darkness and disturbing traces of the past.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Presented in a retro low-poly style inspired by old VHS recordings.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the creatures</h2></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703570/extras/66231095a5398ca3f3cc2d963120b71e.poster.avif?t=1782379430\" width=616 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703570/extras/66231095a5398ca3f3cc2d963120b71e.webm?t=1782379430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703570/extras/66231095a5398ca3f3cc2d963120b71e.mp4?t=1782379430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not defenseless — but survival won’t be easy.</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters with unpredictable behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight back using improvised objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric first-person horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS-inspired retro presentation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-focused gameplay</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every tape hides another piece of the nightmare.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You find two forgotten VHS tapes.<br>No labels. Only dirt and scratches.<br>Curiosity wins — you insert the first tape into an old VCR.<br><br>Someone’s nightmare begins to play.</i></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Park</strong> is an atmospheric first-person VHS horror game where you experience the story hidden inside mysterious recordings.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned locations, collect scattered notes, and survive encounters with terrifying creatures while uncovering what happened inside the park.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore forgotten places</h2></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4703570/extras/ad8c285cb055105f46b76a31147ef0f0.poster.avif?t=1782379430\" width=616